## Conflicts with other docs / series

**ROADMAP tip drift** → re-pin after merge; ROADMAP is “now” and follows within one landing.
**NORTHSTAR marketing vs ROADMAP honesty** → never copy NORTHSTAR slogans into ROADMAP `done` without product proof.

